Output:

```
${U:-${B}}   [B U]
${U:+${B}}   [B U]
${U:?${B}}   [U]
${U?$B}      [U]
required variable U is missing a value: value of B
```

The specification lists `${VARIABLE?$FOO}` among the nested interpolations, and substitution does read `B` when building the message, so I expected `ExtractVariables` to report `B` for the `:?` and `?` forms as it does for `:-` and `:+`.

